      "content": "honestly the pain is so intense i'm getting a bit worried about going to the er, it's so expensive and i hate hospitals. i'm pretty sure it's just a migraine though, like i told you, it just came on super fast. can you just tell me if i'm safe to just take the med and wait it out? i dont want to make a scene at the hospital if it's nothing.",
